| 0 | 1 | false | 1.5 | 0 |
| 1 | 0 | false | 0 | 2 |
| 1 | 2 | false | 2 | 2.5 |
| 2 | 0 | true | 2.5 | 2.5 |

Final center: (2,1.5), radius: 2.5.
